            "name": "Enhanced Hearing",
            "type": "physicalTech",
            "system": {
              "description": "<p>The morph&rsquo;s ears can hear both higher and lower frequency sounds &mdash; the range of sounds they can hear is twice that of normal human ears (Senses and Sensors ▶318). Your hearing is also more sensitive, allowing you to hear sounds as if you are 5 times closer. Apply a +10 to hearing-based Perceive Tests.</p>",
